WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.380
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire
of SCP-191, the Cyborg Child?

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:11.820
Foundation staff snapped a photograph of SCP-191
with SCP-978, The Desire Camera, and this

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.820
was the result:

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.930
"A fully robotic SCP-191 stands upright and
stares at the camera."

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:24.289
All SCP-191 seems to want is to leave the
rest of her humanity behind, and become fully

00:00:24.289 --> 00:00:26.390
robotic once and for all.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:31.619
Another interesting, if tragic, look into
the mind of an inscrutable SCP.

